(44, 17, 'Nicotine Salt', 'nicotine-salt', '/e-liquids/nicotine-salt', NULL, 'Smooth and satisfying nicotine salt e-liquids for pod systems.', '<h2 style=\"margin-top: 20pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Nicotine Salt: Smooth Satisfaction in Every Puff&nbsp;</span></h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Today, </span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"\">nicotine salt</span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> is one of the most widely preferred options when it comes to vaping, and it’s easy to see why. It offers a smooth experience, constant satisfaction, and works well with compact devices. If you own a pod system or small vape device, you probably already know about </span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"\">salt nicotine.</span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">&nbsp;</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Our collection includes different flavors, brands, and bottle sizes that make it easy for you to shop. Whether this is your first time making a purchase or you are a regular shopper, you will find some </span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"\">nicotine salt juice</span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> for yourself.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Here is what makes this category wort