:top;padding:5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Fruit, ice, candy, dessert, and more</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"height:0pt\"><td style=\"border-left:solid #000000 1pt;border-right:solid #000000 1pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 1pt;border-top:solid #000000 1pt;vertical-align:top;padding:5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Trusted brands</span></p></td><td style=\"border-left:solid #000000 1pt;border-right:solid #000000 1pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 1pt;border-top:solid #000000 1pt;vertical-align:top;padding:5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Popular names like Jam Monster, Keep It, RAZ, Oxbar, Urban Tale, and Geek Bar</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">What Is Freebase Nicotine E-Liquid?&nbsp;</span></h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Let\'s explain it in simple terms. </span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"\">Freebase nicotine e-liquid</span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> consists of nicotine in its purest and traditional form, and this type is still the most popular format among vapers today.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">How does it feel? Freebase typically delivers a harsher and more intense throat hit compared to nicotine salts. Because of that, it is common for people to use lower nicotine strengths for freebase nicotine, and they often use it together with high-performing devices generating plenty of vapor. If you are a fan of a major throat-hitting sensation, Freebase should become your favorite.&nbsp;</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">The </span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"\">freebase e-liquid</span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> can be effectively used only with powerful devices, while nicotine salts normally deliver a smoother hit and work great with small pod systems. Neither one is superior. The choice is based on the type of device and personal preferences.</span></p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Top Brands for Freebase E-Liquid&nbsp;</span></h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">The rich taste experience starts with the unique brands. Our collection features all the top-rated Freebase e-liquids, which includes reputable brands like Jam Monster, Keep It, RAZ, Oxbar, Urban Tale, and Geek Bar.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Keep It appeals to those consumers who prefer big bottles of e-liquids. The Keep It 100 OG Blue is a freebase 100 mL bottle that has a nice and refreshing blue slushie flavor ideal for an entire day of vaping. Jam Monster is also a well-known product among e-liquid lovers because it has a strong jam taste, while RAZ has its own unique candy flavors. Oxbar, Urban Tale, and Geek Bar broaden the taste spectrum.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Since brands manufacture both freebase and salt nicotine e-liquids, always check the page with the product description before making a purchase.</span></p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Find the Best Flavors in Freebase Nicotine Juice</span></h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Flavor is the fun part of your</span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> </span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"https://infinityvapeshop.com/disposable-vapes\">disposable vape</a></span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"https://infinityvapeshop.com/disposable-vapes\"> </a>experience. With such a wide range of freebase nicotine juice, you can match your mood any day of the week. Here is a quick tour:</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Fruit blends are the favorites. They include blue raspberry, strawberry, and mixed berry. They taste bright and clean, and they are easy to enjoy from morning to night.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Ice and menthol flavors add a cool, crisp finish. Many vapers pair a fruity flavor with a touch of ice for a refreshing kick.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Dessert and bakery flavors, like cookies, jam, and cream, are rich and satisfying. They are a good option if you like a sweeter vape.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Candy-style flavors bring the energy. They are playful, sweet, and full of fun.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">If you are not sure where to begin? Choose a flavor from two different families, then stock up on the one you love most. Large bottles make it easy to keep your favorite on hand.</span></p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Quick Tips Before You Buy&nbsp;</span></h2><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Make sure you examine your device first. Freebase will work the most effectively with sub-ohm tanks as well as powerful setups, so take a look at your device manual first.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Select a strength that you feel comfortable with. In most cases, freebase feels sharper at higher levels, and therefore many vapers prefer to go lower in strength and enjoy more vapor.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Consider bottle size. A 100mL bottle is worth the investment if you vape a lot, whereas smaller bottles are good for testing flavors.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Make sure that you buy from a website that makes your shopping experience as easy as possible. By shopping online, you can compare different brands, flavors, and sizes and have them delivered to your door. Just make sure that you choose a store that sells high-quality goods and verifies your age.</span></p></li></ul><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Are you ready to fill up?<a href=\"https://infinityvapeshop.com/\"> </a></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"https://infinityvapeshop.com/\">Infinity Vape Shop</a></span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> is a popular and trusted online vape retailer, known for a wide selection, simple browsing, and a smooth shopping experience. Whether you want classic freebase nicotine, a new freebase nicotine juice flavor, or a big bottle of freebase nicotine e-liquid from top brands, Infinity Vape Shop makes it easy to find your match.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">To complete your vaping setup, explore the range of </span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"https://infinityvapeshop.com/vape-accessories\">vape accessories</a></span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> for useful additions and replacements.</span></p><div><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br></span></div>', NULL, NULL, 'Freebase Nicotine E-Liquid - Infinity Vape Shop', 'Shop freebase nicotine juice at Infinity Vape Shop. Explore a range of flavors and options to suit your preferences. Browse our collection today!', 0, 1),
