0 1pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 1pt;border-top:solid #000000 1pt;vertical-align:top;padding:5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Modular pod devices</span></p></td><td style=\"border-left:solid #000000 1pt;border-right:solid #000000 1pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 1pt;border-top:solid #000000 1pt;vertical-align:top;padding:5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">A brand-matched fit, like the Foger Switch Pro Battery</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"height:0pt\"><td style=\"border-left:solid #000000 1pt;border-right:solid #000000 1pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 1pt;border-top:solid #000000 1pt;vertical-align:top;padding:5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Adjustable voltage batteries</span></p></td><td style=\"border-left:solid #000000 1pt;border-right:solid #000000 1pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 1pt;border-top:solid #000000 1pt;vertical-align:top;padding:5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Vapers who like to tweak their hit</span></p></td><td style=\"border-left:solid #000000 1pt;border-right:solid #000000 1pt;border-bottom:solid #000000 1pt;border-top:solid #000000 1pt;vertical-align:top;padding:5pt 5pt 5pt 5pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Voltage control, like the Cookies Twist 510</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Know Your Options: Vape Mod Batteries and Pen Batteries&nbsp;</span></h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">All batteries are different, so it is important to determine which one will work for you.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"\">Vape mod batteries</span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> are specially designed for larger devices. Box mods need steady and dependable power, so we offer all essential varieties in our dedicated category of box mod batteries. If you are using a mod in your daily routine, you have to check the specific type suggested by the manufacturer of your device, since it is vital for both results and safety.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Pen batteries are slim and comfortable to use, as they can easily fit into a pocket. They became popular among vaping fans who prefer a lighter, simpler device with thread-based cartridges, such as the Cookies Twist 510 Thread Battery with 900mAh and adjustable power.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Next, there are batteries for pod systems, designed to fit a specific device. The Foger Switch Pro Battery is a 1200mAh rechargeable battery made specifically for the Switch Pro system, which is known for its power bank and OLED screen. In addition, Off-Stamp also produces a modular pod and battery combination kit called the SW16000, which could be ideal if you prefer a rechargeable battery compatible with different pods.</span></p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Why Rechargeable Vape Batteries Are Worth It&nbsp;</span></h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Currently, the majority of devices available use </span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"\">rechargeable vape batteries</span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">. It is a very convenient option, as you will only have to plug it in and recharge to start using it again.&nbsp; There is no need to keep buying new cells, and a reusable battery is often easier on your budget over time.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Rechargeable batteries are also compatible with modular devices. If a battery is used in a modular vaping device, in case of malfunction, you can change the pod while keeping the battery. The Foger Switch Pro and Off-Stamp\'s modular kits are two good examples of this principle.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">The following tips will help your battery last longer:</span></p><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Charge it with the right cable, not a random one.&nbsp;</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">You should avoid leaving it in a hot car.&nbsp;</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Do not let it drain to zero over and over.&nbsp;</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">If it looks swollen or damaged or gets unusually hot, stop using it and replace it.</span></p></li></ul><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">How to Pick the Best Vape Batteries for Your Device</span></h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Are you wondering what makes the </span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"\">best vape batteries</span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">? It depends on the fit, power, and trust. Here is a simple guide.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Start with compatibility.</span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> The most important rule for </span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"\">batteries for vape</span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> devices is to match your gear. A pod battery will not work with a thread cartridge, and a box mod battery is not made for a slim pen. You should check the device name, the thread type, and the product details before you buy.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Check the capacity. </span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Capacity is shown in mAh, and a bigger number generally means more use between charges. For example, a 1200mAh battery will usually last longer than a 900mAh one, though real-world life also depends on power settings and how often you vape.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Look for useful features</span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">. Adjustable voltage gives you control, smart displays show your battery level, and power bank designs let you recharge on the move.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Buy from a store you trust.</span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> Genuine products are made with quality in mind, so they are safer and more dependable than cheap lookalikes. Make sure to buy from a retailer that sells authentic gear.</span></p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Top Brands to Look For&nbsp;</span></h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">At the moment, we offer battery options that includes Foger, Cookies, and Off-Stamp. If a removable pod system with a special battery is what you are looking for, Foger will work well. In case you are into 510 thread systems, you can give Cookies a thought as well. Finally, Off-Stamp specializes in manufacturing advanced and modern batteries.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Are you looking for a place to buy vape batteries? </span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"https://infinityvapeshop.com/\">Infinity Vape Shop</a></span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> is a popular and trusted online vape retailer, known for a wide selection and a smooth, easy shopping experience. Whether you are looking for vape batteries for your </span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"https://infinityvapeshop.com/disposable-vapes\">disposable vape</a></span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">, vape mod batteries for a bigger setup, or the best vape batteries, Infinity Vape Shop makes it simple to compare and choose.&nbsp;</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Alongside a reliable battery, the right tank can make a difference to your setup. Browse our collection of </span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"https://infinityvapeshop.com/vape-accessories/tanks\">vape tanks</a></span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> for more options.</span></p><div><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br></span></div>', NULL, NULL, 'Vape Batteries - Infinity Vape Shop', 'Shop quality vape battery options at Infinity Vape Shop. Explore our battery collection and find compatible choices for your vaping devices today!', 0, 1);
INSERT INTO `collections` (`id`, `parent_id`, `name`, `slug`, `custom_url_path`, `header_image_url`, `short_description`, `long_description`, `related_collection_ids`, `header_collection_ids`, `meta_title`, `meta_desc`, `sort_order`, `is_active`) VALUES
(62, 60, 'Tanks', 'tanks', '/vape-accessories/tanks', NULL, 'Compact, portable 510-thread and pen vape batteries.', '<h2 style=\"margin-top: 20pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Vape Tanks: Big Flavor Starts Here&nbsp;</span></h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">If you enjoy adjusting your vaping experience to find the exact flavor, the tank is essential. The </span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"\">vape tank</span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> contains the e-liquid and the coil and determines how the flavor and the vapor feel when inhaled. Choosing a good vape tank will benefit your entire vaping experience.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Whether you just switched to a refillable </span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"https://infinityvapeshop.com/disposable-vapes\">disposable vape</a></span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> or are looking to upgrade, our tank collection is here to help you find what suits your needs. Here is a summary of why tanks are so popular:</span></p><br><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Refillable:</span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> You can fill the tank with your favorite e-liquid and change it anytime you want.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Flavor Control:</span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> Different coils and airflow settings allow you to choose the taste you want.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Affordable:</span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> A tank with a replaceable coil is more budget-friendly than constantly swapping devices.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Variety of Options</span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">: Experience everything from tight mouth-to-lung pulls to big clouds.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Works with Mods</span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">: The tank can be used with most box mods and vape mod batteries.</span></p></li></ul><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Vape Tanks: What You Should Know Before You Shop&nbsp;</span></h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">If you are unfamiliar with tanks, don\'t worry. Here is a rapid and straightforward guide.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">A tank comprises three key components: the glass or plastic container that contains the liquid, the coil that is used to heat it, and the airflow control that manages the air intake. In general, more airflow increases vapor production and cools the vape. Reduced airflow results in a tighter draw, producing a more flavorful vape that many pod users prefer.&nbsp;</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Tank size is crucial. Larger tanks hold more liquid, which means fewer refills, while smaller tanks are lighter and more portable. Determine your needs based on your lifestyle and decide accordingly.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Another key component, </span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"https://infinityvapeshop.com/vape-accessories/coils\">vape coils</a></span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">, requires no special tools to replace and simply sits inside the tank and wears down with time. When the taste of your e-liquid starts to fade or tastes burnt, it\'s time to change your coils. Make sure you buy appropriate coils that correspond with your tank, as coils are specifically specified for certain types of tanks.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">To wrap up, you need to keep the power source in mind. You need to have a compatible device with the </span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"\">vape tank</span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">, so make sure to check the thread interface and power range before purchasing. In case of uncertainty, check product specifications or ask the vendor.</span></p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Which E-Liquid Works With a Tank?&nbsp;</span></h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Tanks use </span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"https://infinityvapeshop.com/e-liquids\">e-liquids</a></span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> that can be refilled. Generally, bigger and high-capacity tanks are compatible with </span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"https://infinityvapeshop.com/e-liquids/freebase-nicotine\">freebase nicotine</a></span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> in larger bottles, like 100 mL. In contrast, smaller low-power tanks and pod devices are ideal for </span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"https://infinityvapeshop.com/e-liquids/nicotine-salt\">nicotine salts</a></span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">. Check the specifications of your tank and coil to select the right e-liquids. Zero-nicotine e-liquids can also be used if preferred.</span></p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Find the Best Vape Tanks for Your Style</span></h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">So, what are the</span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"\"> best vape tanks</span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">? The honest answer is that it depends on you. A few simple questions will point you in the right direction.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">How do you like to vape?</span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> If you enjoy a tight, cigarette-style draw, choose a tank with small airflow and a lower-power coil. If you like big clouds and bold flavor, look for a tank with open airflow and a higher-power coil.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">How much do you want to refill? </span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Usually, bigger capacity means fewer top-ups. Smaller sizes mean less bulk.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">How easy is it to maintain?</span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> You should look for tanks with simple fill ports and easy coil changes. A tank that is easy to use is one you will enjoy more.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Is it from a brand you trust?</span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> Quality brands build tanks with better materials, tighter seals, and fewer leaks.</span></p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Popular Tank Brands Vapers Know&nbsp;</span></h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">In the tank manufacturing industry, there are several big names like Geekvape, Uwell, Vaporesso, SMOK, and Voopoo. These companies have created an enviable reputation before they offer durable and well-designed tanks with several variants. Geekvape has also produced RAZ devices, which are famous among vaping enthusiasts. Each of these brands has its own advantages, such as very sleek designs or very powerful builds, and it is better to look at a few brands before deciding.</span></p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Why Buy Vape Tanks Online?&nbsp;</span></h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">When you </span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"\">buy vape tanks online</span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">, you have more options than any physical store could provide. You can compare different sizes, coil types, and compatibility in one spot and have your order delivered. It is a fast and easy way to find the parts that fit your device. Just make sure that the store you are purchasing from is authentic and has a system to make sure that you are of legal age to purchase those items.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Ready to upgrade your setup?</span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> </span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"https://infinityvapeshop.com/\">Infinity Vape Shop</a></span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> is a popular online vape retailer, known for a wide range and a smooth shopping experience. Whether you are exploring the best vape tanks, comparing options for your next vape tank, or planning to buy vape tanks online from a store you can count on, they make it easy to browse, compare, and order.</span></p><div><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br></span></div>', NULL, NULL, 'Vape Tanks - Infinity Vape Shop', 'Shop quality vape tanks at Infinity Vape Shop. Explore different styles and options to upgrade your setup. Browse our collection and shop today!', 0, 1),
(63, 60, 'Coils', 'coils', '/vape-accessories/coils', NULL, 'OEM replacement pods and cartridges for pod vape systems.', '<h2 style=\"margin-top: 20pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Vape Coils: Fresh Flavor Starts with a Fresh Coil&nbsp;</span></h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Perhaps you\'ve noticed a favorite flavor has started tasting a little less than perfect, maybe even a little burnt? Chances are your coil is tired and needs to be replaced. </span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"\">Vape coils</span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> are the small heating elements within your device that convert e-liquid into vapor and are vital to the taste and sensation of every puff you take.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Changing a coil is very easy and can be done within a few minutes. It can give your vape that fresh, shiny new feeling again. Our coil collection is here to take the guesswork out of this process so that you can find your best match.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Here is why coils deserve a spot on your shopping list:</span></p><br><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Better flavor:</span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> A fresh coil brings back crisp, clean taste to your vapor.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Smoother vapor:</span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> New coils heat evenly, so every puff feels more consistent.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Easy upkeep: </span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Most coil changes take less than a minute.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Many styles: </span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Choose from different resistances and builds to suit your vaping style.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Smart savings:</span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> Replacing a coil is often cheaper than replacing your whole device.</span></p></li></ul><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Coils for Vape Devices: How They Work and What to Look For&nbsp;</span></h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Let\'s keep this simple. Each tank or pod is filled with a coil surrounded by cotton. When you press a button or draw on it, the coil heats up, which burns the e-liquid soaked in the cotton and converts it into a vapor. This is the whole process, which takes mere seconds to complete.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Because </span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"\">coils for vape </span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">devices come in many shapes and sizes, a few details are worth knowing before you buy.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Resistance (ohms). </span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">This figure indicates how the coil behaves. Low-ohm coils produce more vapor and heat but require a higher wattage. High-ohm coils produce less vapor and heat and are ideal for tight, mouth-to-lung drags; hence, they are mostly used in the pod system.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Coil type and material.</span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> Mesh coils distribute heat over a greater area and are loved by vapers for their great flavor. Many modern devices use the dual or quad-mesh coil formats, as seen in everyday disposables and pod systems.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Compatibility.</span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> It is the most essential rule. Coils are designed for specific tanks and pod systems. Thus, a coil that is suitable for one type will not work for the other type. Always verify the name and model of your device before you add anything to your shopping cart.</span></p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 12pt; margin-bottom: 2pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">When Should You Change Your Coil?</span></h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Are you uncertain about whether your coil needs to be replaced? Here are a few signs to look out for. The taste is burnt or bland. The vapor being produced is unusually thin. There is gurgling, leaking, or a loud noise coming from your device. Or maybe you simply think that the hit is not what it used to be. In all of these cases, it is time to change the coil.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">There are also some best practices for maximizing your coil lifespan. Once you replace the coil, let it soak for a few minutes so that the cotton can absorb the juice. Do not chain vape; doing so can dry the coil out faster than expected. Finally, make sure that your device is clean, as the residue can cut down on your coils.</span></p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Finding the Best Vape Coils for Your Style&nbsp;</span></h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">So, what are the</span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"\"> best vape coils?</span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> It depends on how you like to vape. Here is a quick way to choose.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">If you love big flavor and thick vapor, pick a lower-resistance mesh coil and pair it with a tank built for more airflow and higher power. If you prefer the feel of a cigarette, higher-resistance coils intended for these types of devices will work for you. Furthermore, for simplicity, pre-made coils that match the device’s specifications should be chosen.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">The right </span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"https://infinityvapeshop.com/e-liquids\">e-liquid</a></span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> type plays a great role in vaping. Powerful devices should be paired with </span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"https://infinityvapeshop.com/e-liquids/freebase-nicotine\">freebase nicotine</a></span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> products, while the lower-powered pod coils work effectively with </span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"https://infinityvapeshop.com/e-liquids/nicotine-salt\">nicotine salts</a></span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">.</span></p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Brands Vapers Trust for Coils&nbsp;</span></h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Geekvape, Uwell, Vaporesso, SMOK, and Voopoo are names familiar to many coil fans out there. They produce reliable, high-quality coils for a range of devices. Geekvape, too, makes its own RAZ devices, which are among our popular brands. When buying coils, always make sure you buy coils that comply with the brand and model of your tank or pod.</span></p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Why Buy Vape Coils Online?&nbsp;</span></h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Shopping for</span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"\"> vaping coils online</span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> will save your valuable time while allowing you to see what is available on the market. You get to compare the resistances of various coils, check their compatibility, and ensure that you have some spare coils at home all in one shopping trip, rather than going from shop to shop. Having some coils at home means you will always be ready to vape. Just make sure to choose only a reputable shop that sells real vaping gear and verifies age.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Ready for a fresher flavor?</span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> </span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"https://infinityvapeshop.com/\">Infinity Vape Shop</a></span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> is a trusted online vape retailer, known for a wide selection and an easy, friendly shopping experience. Whether you want the best vape coils for your tank, reliable coils for vape pods and mods, or a simple way to order vape coils online, we help you browse, compare, and check out in just a few clicks.</span></p><div><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br></span></div>', NULL, NULL, 'Vape Coils - Infinity Vape Shop', 'Upgrade your setup with vape coils at Infinity Vape Shop. Explore replacement options, discover your match, and shop our collection today!', 0, 1),
