(76, 60, 'Chargers', 'chargers', '/vape-accessories/chargers', NULL, '', '<h2 style=\"margin-top: 20pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Vape Chargers: Keep Your Device Ready, Every Time&nbsp;</span></h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">A great vape is only as good as its</span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> </span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"https://infinityvapeshop.com/vape-accessories/batteries\">battery</a></span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">, and a battery is only as good as its charger. Moreover, battery quality depends heavily on its charger. The perfect </span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"\">vape charger</span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> will help charge your vape effectively, improve its life, and make sure that your vape is not out of charge at an inconvenient time.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Whether you use a pod, pen, or mod, different chargers are available. Our collection of various chargers gives you a chance to find the right one for your device.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Here is what a good charger brings to your routine:</span></p><br><ul style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Always ready</span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">: You can wake up to a full battery and go about your day.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Right fit:</span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> Chargers made for your device keep power flowing safely.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Longer battery life:</span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> Proper charging habits help batteries stay healthy.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Portable options:</span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> Compact cables and docks that can be kept in a bag or pocket.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: disc; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Wallet-friendly: </span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">There are plenty of choices to suit different budgets.</span></p></li></ul><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">How Does a Vape Battery Charger Work?&nbsp;</span></h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Let’s make this straightforward. A</span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"\"> vape battery charger </span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">provides consistent electricity to your device from a wall power source or a computer or power bank. The charger stops sending power once the battery is full. Different devices charge in different ways, so it helps to know your setup.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">With built-in batteries, charging takes place directly within your device and usually via USB-C. Many modern pod and disposable systems work this way too. For instance, the Foger Switch Pro uses a 1200 mAh battery, which enables charging inside its pod system, while some other popular devices allow USB-C charging.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Dock-style chargers hold the device in place while it charges. JUUL is an example of this; the device charges on the USB Charging Dock that comes with it. The charging process takes approximately one hour as per JUUL instructions.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">External battery chargers are used with removable batteries that are present in larger devices. The battery must be removed from the device and charged separately. Box mods are usually charged externally, and this is often safer and quicker.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Regardless of what type is used, the same rule applies: always use a charger that’s right for the battery used with vape equipment.</span></p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Smart Charging Tips for Longer Battery Life</span></h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">There are a few simple habits that can make a big difference.</span></p><br><ol style=\"margin-bottom: 0px; padding-inline-start: 48px;\"><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">You should use the right cable and adapter. Cheap, unknown chargers can deliver uneven power, which may harm your battery. When possible, use the charger that came with your device or one from a trusted brand.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Do not charge on soft surfaces. Keep your device on a hard, flat spot, such as a desk or table, away from bedding and couches.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">It is recommended to avoid heat. Do not leave your device charging in a hot car or in direct sun.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">You should unplug your device when done. There is no need to leave it plugged in for long periods after it reaches full charge.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Do not mix and match your chargers. If you use removable cells, never charge old and new batteries together, and keep them in a case when not in use.</span></p></li><li dir=\"ltr\" style=\"list-style-type: decimal; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre;\" aria-level=\"1\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" role=\"presentation\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Check for damage. If a battery looks swollen, dented, or gets unusually hot, stop using it and replace it.</span></p></li></ol><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Looking for Affordable Vape Battery Chargers?&nbsp;</span></h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Good news: you do not have to overspend.</span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"\"> Affordable vape battery chargers</span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> are easy to find. If you are using a device that has a built-in battery, you may not need anything more than a reliable USB cable or a simple dock. However, if you are using a device that has removable batteries, it is worth spending a little bit more to buy an external charger to protect your battery life and your device.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">When shopping for chargers, do not simply look at the price. Make sure that the charger works with your device and has a suitable connector. Be careful to buy the charger from a store that sells only high-quality products.</span></p><h2 dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 18pt; margin-bottom: 6pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Trusted Brands and Where to Find Them</span></h2><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">The names most commonly associated with vape charging are Nitecore, Efest, and XTAR for external battery chargers, and also Foger and JUUL for manufacturers making matched chargers for their own devices. The matched chargers are often the easiest to use since they are designed for your specific device. People who use mods with detachable batteries prefer external chargers.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Before making a purchase, make sure that your battery is the type you need and that you use a reputable supplier.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Ready to power up? </span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"https://infinityvapeshop.com/\">Infinity Vape Shop</a></span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> is a popular and trusted online vape retailer, known for a wide selection and an easy, friendly shopping experience. Whether you need a dependable </span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"\">vape charger,</span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> a vape battery charger for your mod cells, or affordable vape battery chargers that fit your budget, Infinity Vape Shop makes it simple to browse, compare, and order. Pair the right charger for vape devices with quality batteries and pods, and keep your setup running smoothly.</span></p><br><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">If you\'re considering a complete vaping setup, browse our collection of </span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 400; font-variant: normal; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><a href=\"https://infinityvapeshop.com/vape-kits\">vape kits</a></span><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> for more options.</span></p><div><span style=\"font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br></span></div>', NULL, NULL, '', '', 0, 1);
