(255, 23, 'How long does a 5000-puff disposable vape last?', 'Moderate vapers usually get about 1 to 2 weeks, depending on how often they vape.', 1, '2026-11-02 23:29:31'),
(256, 23, 'Is a rechargeable 5000-puff vape worth it?', 'Yes. A USB Type-C charge helps the battery last until the e-liquid is finished.', 2, '2026-11-02 23:29:31'),
(257, 23, 'Do these vapes contain nicotine?', 'Most have 5% (50 mg) nicotine salt. Lower-strength 2% and zero-nicotine options are also available.', 3, '2026-11-02 23:29:31'),
(258, 23, 'Are they good for beginners?', 'Yes. They need no refilling, no coil changes, and no settings.', 4, '2026-11-02 23:29:31'),
(259, 23, 'Who can buy a disposable vape?', 'Only adults aged 21 and older, with age verification at checkout.', 5, '2026-11-02 23:29:31'),
(260, 24, 'How long does a 10,000-puff vape last?', 'Moderate vapers usually get about 1 to 2 weeks, depending on how often they vape.', 1, '2026-11-02 23:29:42'),
(261, 24, 'Can the 10K puff disposable vapes be recharged?', 'Yes. Most use a USB Type-C port, so the battery can last until the e-liquid is gone.', 2, '2026-11-02 23:29:42'),
(262, 24, 'What nicotine options are available in these devices?', 'Most have 5% (50 mg) nicotine salt. Lower 2% (20 mg) and zero-nicotine options are also available.', 3, '2026-11-02 23:29:42'),
(263, 24, 'Is a 10K puff vape good for beginners?', 'Yes. There’s no refilling, no coil changes, and no settings to learn.', 4, '2026-11-02 23:29:42'),
(264, 24, 'Who can buy one?', 'Only adults aged 21 and older, with age verification at checkout.', 5, '2026-11-02 23:29:42'),
(305, 17, 'What is the difference between salt nic and freebase?', 'Salt Nic uses nicotine salts, which are common in pod devices. Freebase is the traditional style, often used in larger devices.', 1, '2026-11-02 23:43:02'),
(306, 17, 'Can I use any vape juice in any device?', 'No. You should check your device guide first. Some devices work best with Salt Nic, others with Freebase.', 2, '2026-11-02 23:43:02'),
(307, 17, 'Are there any nicotine-free options?', 'Yes. Zero-nicotine bottles are available for people who want flavor without nicotine.', 3, '2026-11-02 23:43:02'),
(308, 17, 'How do I choose the best flavor?', 'Start with the types you already enjoy, such as fruit, dessert, or mint, then try a few small bottles.', 4, '2026-11-02 23:43:02'),
(309, 17, 'Who can buy e-liquids?', 'Only adults of legal age. In the US, that means 21 or older.', 5, '2026-11-02 23:43:02'),
(310, 18, 'What are nicotine pouches made of?', 'They are small pouches containing nicotine, flavoring, and other ingredients. They do not contain tobacco leaves.', 1, '2026-11-02 23:43:20'),
(311, 18, 'How long should I keep a pouch in?', 'Many people keep one in for about 20 to 30 minutes. You should follow the guidance on your can.', 2, '2026-11-02 23:43:20'),
(312, 18, 'Which strength should a beginner pick?', 'A lower strength, such as 3 mg or 4 mg, is a gentle place to start.', 3, '2026-11-02 23:43:20'),
(313, 18, 'Do pouches need to be stored a certain way?', 'Keep the can closed, in a cool, dry place, and away from children and pets.', 4, '2026-11-02 23:43:20'),
(314, 18, 'Are nicotine pouches for everyone?', 'No. They are only for adults of legal age and are not a good fit for non-nicotine users.', 5, '2026-11-02 23:43:20'),
(315, 29, 'What is a nicotine-free vape?', 'It is a vape or e-liquid that contains 0 mg of nicotine. You still get flavor and vapor.', 1, '2026-11-02 23:43:53'),
(316, 29, 'Is a non-nicotine vape the same as a zero-nicotine vape?', 'Yes. Both terms mean the product has no nicotine in it.', 2, '2026-11-02 23:43:53'),
(317, 29, 'Can I use 0 mg e-liquid in any device?', 'Only in devices made for refillable e-liquid. You should always check your device guide first.', 3, '2026-11-02 23:43:53'),
(318, 29, 'Are nicotine-free vapes completely safe?', 'No. They remove nicotine, but vaping still carries unknown long-term risks.', 4, '2026-11-02 23:43:53'),
(319, 29, 'Who can buy nic-free vapes?', 'Only adults of legal age. In the US, that means 21 or older.', 5, '2026-11-02 23:43:53'),
(320, 44, 'What is nicotine salt?', 'It is nicotine in a salt form, used in e-liquids to give a smoother feel, especially in pod devices.', 1, '2026-11-02 23:44:20'),
(321, 44, 'Is Salt-Nic better than Freebase?', 'Neither is better for everyone. Salt suits small, low-power devices, while freebase suits larger setups.', 2, '2026-11-02 23:44:20'),
(322, 44, 'Can I use salt nic in any vape?', 'No. You should check your device guide, since some devices are made for freebase instead.', 3, '2026-11-02 23:44:20'),
(323, 44, 'How strong should the nicotine content be in my vape?', 'Start with a lower strength if you are new. Always check the label and follow the guidance on the bottle.', 4, '2026-11-02 23:44:20'),
(324, 44, 'Who can buy nicotine salt e-liquid?', 'Only adults of legal age. In the US, that means 21 or older.', 5, '2026-11-02 23:44:20'),
(325, 45, 'What is freebase nicotine?', 'It is the traditional form of nicotine used in e-liquids, often chosen for larger devices.', 1, '2026-11-02 23:44:35'),
(326, 45, 'How is freebase different from nicotine salt?', 'Freebase feels sharper and suits bigger devices. Salt feels smoother and suits small pod devices.', 2, '2026-11-02 23:44:35'),
(327, 45, 'What kind of devices work best with Freebase?', 'Sub-ohm tanks and other higher-powered, high-airflow devices usually work best.', 3, '2026-11-02 23:44:35'),
(328, 45, 'Why are freebase bottles so large?', 'Many are made for bigger devices that use more liquid, so 100 mL sizes are common.', 4, '2026-11-02 23:44:35'),
(329, 45, 'Who can buy Freebase e-liquid?', 'Only adults of legal age. In the US, that means 21 or older.', 5, '2026-11-02 23:44:35'),
(330, 60, 'What is a vape accessory?', 'Vape accessories are tools or materials that are helpful for your vape device, including pods, batteries, coils, and tanks.', 1, '2026-11-02 23:44:48'),
(331, 60, 'How often should vape coils be replaced?', 'It varies depending on usage. You should consider changing it when you feel like the coil is burnt or has lost its original taste.', 2, '2026-11-02 23:44:48'),
(332, 60, 'Can I use any pod on my device?', 'No. Pods are made for certain devices. Thus, you should make sure your pod is made for the specific brand.', 3, '2026-11-02 23:44:48'),
(333, 60, 'What is the best way to choose vape batteries?', 'You should match your device, check the mAh capacity, and look for features like USB charging.', 4, '2026-11-02 23:44:48'),
(334, 60, 'Are batteries of vape devices safe?', 'Yes, if they are used properly. Always use the right kind of batteries, charge them correctly, and store them carefully.', 5, '2026-11-02 23:44:48'),
(340, 62, 'What is a vape tank?', 'It is the part of a refillable vape that holds your e-liquid and the coil.', 1, '2026-11-02 23:45:14'),
(341, 62, 'How do I know which tank is suitable for my device?', 'You should check the thread type and power range in the product details and match them to your device.', 2, '2026-11-02 23:45:14'),
(342, 62, 'How often should I change the coil?', 'Make sure to change it when the flavor gets dull or burnt. This varies with how often you vape.', 3, '2026-11-02 23:45:14'),
(343, 62, 'Can I use any e-liquid in a tank?', 'Most tanks work with refillable e-liquid, but check your tank and coil for the recommended type and strength.', 4, '2026-11-02 23:45:14'),
(344, 62, 'Who can buy vape tanks?', 'Only adults of legal age. In the US, that means 21 or older.', 5, '2026-11-02 23:45:14'),
(355, 76, 'Can I use any charger for my vape?', 'No. You should use a charger made for your device or battery type to stay safe.', 1, '2026-11-02 23:45:53'),
(356, 76, 'How long does a vape take to charge?', 'It varies by device and battery size. Please check your product guide for exact times.', 2, '2026-11-02 23:45:53'),
(357, 76, 'Is it safe to charge a vape overnight?', 'It is best to avoid it. Unplug once your device is full, and charge on a hard, flat surface.', 3, '2026-11-02 23:45:53'),
(358, 76, 'Do I need a separate charger for mod batteries?', 'Often yes. Removable cells are usually charged in an external battery charger.', 4, '2026-11-02 23:45:53'),
(359, 76, 'Who can buy vape chargers?', 'Only adults of legal age. In the US, that means 21 or older.', 5, '2026-11-02 23:45:53'),
(365, 63, 'What do vape coils do?', 'They heat your e-liquid and turn it into vapor.', 1, '2026-11-02 23:51:02'),
(366, 63, 'How often should I replace a coil?', 'You can change it when the flavor gets dull or burnt. This depends on how often you vape and the liquid you use.', 2, '2026-11-02 23:51:02'),
(367, 63, 'Will any coil fit my tank?', 'No. Coils are made for specific tanks and pods, so always check your model first.', 3, '2026-11-02 23:51:02'),
(368, 63, 'What does coil resistance mean?', 'It is measured in ohms. Lower resistance usually gives warmer, bigger vapor, while higher resistance suits tighter draws.', 4, '2026-11-02 23:51:02'),
(369, 63, 'Who can buy vape coils?', 'Only adults of legal age. In the US, that means 21 or older.', 5, '2026-11-02 23:51:02'),
(370, 27, 'Do more puffs mean a higher level of nicotine intake?', 'Not always. The amount of nicotine varies according to the nicotine content; refer to the instruction manual for more information.', 1, '2026-11-02 23:57:22'),
(371, 27, 'Is it possible to refill the e-liquid?', 'No. The chamber is not refillable; however, the battery can be recharged.', 2, '2026-11-02 23:57:22'),
(372, 27, 'Is the 30K device heavy?', 'This solely depends on the model you buy; check product details.', 3, '2026-11-02 23:57:22'),
(373, 27, 'Are there options with zero nicotine?', 'Yes, some disposable devices are nicotine-free.', 4, '2026-11-02 23:57:22'),
(374, 27, 'What are the advantages of a 30K compared to smaller devices?', 'With a 30K device you will not need to buy more refill cartridges, which means a longer-lasting vaping experience.', 5, '2026-11-02 23:57:22'),
(375, 28, 'Can I refill a 50K disposable vape?', 'No. The chamber is sealed, but you can recharge the battery.', 1, '2026-11-02 23:57:33'),
(376, 28, 'Is a 50K device stronger than a smaller one?', 'Not by default. Strength depends on the nicotine percentage.', 2, '2026-11-02 23:57:33'),
(377, 28, 'Are there nicotine-free 50K options?', 'Zero-nicotine disposables exist, but the choices vary by range.', 3, '2026-11-02 23:57:33'),
(378, 28, 'What does “modular” mean?', 'Some devices use magnetic, swappable pods, so you can change pods on the same device.', 4, '2026-11-02 23:57:33'),
(379, 28, 'Is 50K too much for a casual vaper?', 'It can be. If you vape only now and then, a smaller size may be a better fit.', 5, '2026-11-02 23:57:33'),
(380, 26, 'Can you refill the 20K disposable vape?', 'No, the cartridge is securely sealed, but the rechargeable battery is present.', 1, '2026-11-02 23:57:41'),
(381, 26, 'Does a 20K disposable vape work better compared to a 10K?', 'Not necessarily; strength depends on the nicotine level, not the puff count.', 2, '2026-11-02 23:57:41'),
(382, 26, 'Will the battery last the entire lifespan of the device?', 'Most 20K vapes come equipped with USB-C charging so that you can keep charging as needed.', 3, '2026-11-02 23:57:41'),
(383, 26, 'Are 20K vape disposables suitable for beginners?', 'Yes, provided that you choose a low- or no-nicotine disposable vape.', 4, '2026-11-02 23:57:41'),
(384, 26, 'What should I consider before making a purchase?', 'You should pay attention to flavor, nicotine strength, and special features, and whether the seller ensures authenticity.', 5, '2026-11-02 23:57:41'),
(385, 25, 'How much longer does a 15K vape last than a 10K?', 'The 15K vape gives approximately 50% more puffs, thus prolonging its lifespan when compared to a 10K device.', 1, '2026-11-02 23:57:48'),
(386, 25, 'Can a person refill a 15 K disposable vape?', 'A 15K vape cannot be refilled, but it can be recharged.', 2, '2026-11-02 23:57:48'),
(387, 25, 'Are 15K puff vapes too strong for beginners?', 'Puff count does not correlate to potency, but nicotine level does; therefore, beginners can choose vape devices with 2% or zero nicotine.', 3, '2026-11-02 23:57:48'),
(388, 25, 'How does one charge their vape?', 'Most disposables can be charged with a standard USB Type-C cable.', 4, '2026-11-02 23:57:48'),
(389, 25, 'Is a 15K vape worth it for occasional users?', 'Not always. If you vape only now and then, a smaller device may fit better.', 5, '2026-11-02 23:57:48'),
(405, 61, 'How long does a vape battery last?', 'It depends on capacity, settings, and how often you vape. A higher mAh usually lasts longer.', 1, '2026-11-03 16:49:56'),
(406, 61, 'Can I use any battery with my vape?', 'No. You should always match the battery to your device model or thread type.', 2, '2026-11-03 16:49:56'),
(407, 61, 'Are rechargeable vape batteries better than disposable ones?', 'Many vapers prefer them since you can reuse them and replace only the pods or cartridges.', 3, '2026-11-03 16:49:57'),
(408, 61, 'What does adjustable voltage mean?', 'It lets you raise or lower the power to change how your hit feels.', 4, '2026-11-03 16:49:57'),
(409, 61, 'How can I keep my vape battery safe?', 'Make sure to use the right charger, avoid heat, store it safely, and replace it if it is damaged.', 5, '2026-11-03 16:49:57'),
(415, 77, 'What is included in a vape kit?', 'Most kits include a device and a pod or tank. Many also include a charging cable.', 1, '2026-11-03 16:52:31'),
(416, 77, 'What is the best vape kit for beginners?', 'A simple pod kit is a good place to begin. It is easy to use and needs little setup.', 2, '2026-11-03 16:52:31'),
(417, 77, 'What is the difference between a pod kit and a mod kit?', 'Pod kits are small and simple. Mod kits are larger and give you more control over power and airflow.', 3, '2026-11-03 16:52:31'),
(418, 77, 'Can I refill every vape kit?', 'No. Some kits use refillable pods, while others use sealed, pre-filled pods. You should check the product details.', 4, '2026-11-03 16:52:31'),
(419, 77, 'Who can buy vape kits?', 'Only adults of legal age. In the US, that means 21 or older.', 5, '2026-11-03 16:52:31'),
(450, 16, 'What is a disposable vape and how does it work?', 'A disposable vape is an all-in-one prefilled and precharged electronic nicotine delivery device. It features an integrated battery, mesh coil, and salt nicotine e-liquid tank. You simply inhale on the mouthpiece to activate it, with no refilling or complicated maintenance needed.', 1, '2026-11-03 17:46:00'),
(451, 16, 'How many puffs can I expect from a disposable vape?', 'Puff counts range from 5,000 up to 50,000+ puffs depending on the model and mode selected (e.g., Smooth/Regular Mode vs Turbo/Pulse Mode). Moderate vapers typically get 2 to 4 weeks of regular use from devices rated 15,000 puffs or higher.', 2, '2026-11-03 17:46:00'),
(452, 16, 'Are the disposable vapes sold on New Vape 100% authentic?', 'Yes! Every device sold on New Vape is sourced directly from certified master distributors and authorized manufacturers. Every unit includes an anti-counterfeit scratch-off code you can verify directly on the brand website.', 3, '2026-11-03 17:46:00'),
(453, 16, 'How do I recharge my disposable vape when the battery runs out?', 'Most high-capacity disposables feature a Type-C USB charging port located on the bottom or side. Connect the device to a standard 5V/1A USB power source for 30 to 45 minutes for a full charge.', 4, '2026-11-03 17:46:00'),
(454, 16, 'What nicotine strength is in disposable vapes?', 'The industry benchmark for disposable vapes is 5% (50mg/mL) nicotine salt formulation. We also offer selected 0% (zero-nicotine) and lower strength options in our catalog.', 5, '2026-11-03 17:46:00');

